 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Inkya no Ore ga Sekigae de S-kyuu Bishoujo ni Kakomaretara Himitsu no Kankei ga Hajimatta"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "When the Introverted Me Got Surrounded by S-Tier Beauties After a Seat Change, a Secret Relationship Began"
   },
   {
    "ja": "陰キャの俺が席替えでS級美少女に囲まれたら秘密の関係が始まった"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "My peaceful school life… is officially over.\n\nIzumiya Ryouta, an introverted otaku, suddenly finds himself surrounded by the top three beauties of the class after a seat change.\n\nIn front of him sits the little-sister-type Miyama Airi. To his left, the cool and detached gyaru, Ichinose Yuria. And to his right, the refined, black-haired class rep, Kuroki Ruri.\n\nOn the surface, they’re flawless beauties—but Ryouta stumbles upon secrets that none of them can ever let out…\n\n\"P-Please…! Just don’t tell anyone about this!\"\n\"From now on, we’re in that kind of relationship.\"\n\"This is a secret… just between you and me, Ryouta-kun.\"\n\nAll he wanted was a quiet otaku life—so how did things end up like this?!\n\nCaught between three troublesome girls, an introverted otaku desperately fights to avoid any more chaos in this love-comedy showdown!"
  },
